{"about_the_game":"<i>&quot;I remember getting the call vividly. I was trying to finish up for the day, but a stack of paperwork was keeping me late. To be honest, I was also looking for reasons not to go home. My phone rang, I answered it, and the director of the institute was talking, albeit disjointedly, about something that had turned up in a recent survey of The Sirena Deep.&quot;</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Overview</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958930/extras/DescriptionGIF1.gif?t=1717668672\" /><br><br>Explore a mysterious, abandoned underwater facility at the bottom of the Mariana trench. Who built it? What was it used for? Perhaps you will find answers, or perhaps the answers will find you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958930/extras/DescriptionGIF2.gif?t=1717668672\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2.5D platforming mechanics.<br></li><li>Retro PSX-inspired visuals.<br></li><li>Full voice acting.<br></li><li>Soundtrack by <strong>beee girlll and Giraffe Cat</strong>.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1958930?t=1717668672","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1958930?t=1717668672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1717668672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1717668672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<i>&quot;I remember getting the call vividly. I was trying to finish up for the day, but a stack of